    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidengen</strong> is a multiplayer PvP shooter that blends stealth, parkour, and vertical combat. The action takes place on a mysterious alien planet where a scientific expedition has vanished without a trace. You are a volunteer sent to investigate \u2014 but something went terribly wrong. Now, only one can survive, and the evacuation ship has room for just one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Battle Royale with a twist</strong>: A last-player-standing PvP experience with no teams \u2014 only one survivor makes it out alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Jetpack traversal</strong>: Use your jetpack with an overheat system to move quickly and gain vertical advantage. Time your flights carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Stealth and realistic lighting</strong>: Hide in shadows, ambush your enemies, and adapt to dynamic lighting that affects visibility and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Vertical level design</strong>: Giant mushrooms, cliffs, and industrial structures create multi-level battlefields. Height is a strategic asset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Dynamic weather and day-night cycle</strong>: Sandstorms, rainfall, snowfall, and transitions from bright daylight to pitch-black night change every match. Adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Light parkour elements</strong>: Climb, slide, and maneuver around the terrain. Mobility gives you an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Win with cunning, not just firepower</strong>: Outsmart your opponents. Use the environment and clever tactics to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Short, intense matches</strong>: Each game lasts 10\u201315 minutes. Every choice matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no between-match progression \u2014 all players start equal. Your survival depends entirely on skill, strategy, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Coming soon</strong>: Additional game modes including <strong>Deathmatch</strong> and <strong>Extraction</strong> are planned for future updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidengen</strong> is a multiplayer PvP shooter that blends stealth, parkour, and vertical combat. The action takes place on a mysterious alien planet where a scientific expedition has vanished without a trace. You are a volunteer sent to investigate \u2014 but something went terribly wrong. Now, only one can survive, and the evacuation ship has room for just one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Battle Royale with a twist</strong>: A last-player-standing PvP experience with no teams \u2014 only one survivor makes it out alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Jetpack traversal</strong>: Use your jetpack with an overheat system to move quickly and gain vertical advantage. Time your flights carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Stealth and realistic lighting</strong>: Hide in shadows, ambush your enemies, and adapt to dynamic lighting that affects visibility and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Vertical level design</strong>: Giant mushrooms, cliffs, and industrial structures create multi-level battlefields. Height is a strategic asset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Dynamic weather and day-night cycle</strong>: Sandstorms, rainfall, snowfall, and transitions from bright daylight to pitch-black night change every match. Adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Light parkour elements</strong>: Climb, slide, and maneuver around the terrain. Mobility gives you an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Win with cunning, not just firepower</strong>: Outsmart your opponents. Use the environment and clever tactics to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Short, intense matches</strong>: Each game lasts 10\u201315 minutes. Every choice matters.</p></